# Generated userprogram test executables. `build.sh` assembles and links
# these from the `.s` sources sitting next to them, and the kernel embeds
# them via `include_bytes!`, so they are build outputs, not sources. The
# `.s` files themselves, the linker scripts, and real fixtures (e.g.
# `userprog/classes.dex`) ARE tracked.
source/nykernel/userprog/*.elf
source/nykernel/userprog/*.exe

# Rust build output (also matched by the repo-root `target/` rule; kept
# here so the kernel tree is self-describing if ever split out).
source/nykernel/target/
